his would occur, or is it possible there is a race condition during teardown or something or that nature."],["e752b9f8_03635394",17,-21,0,"Why is this removed?"],["24766063_cc9ad2a3",45,-15,0,"What's the behavior when a scrolled-away font is selected and the bottom sheet is shown again. Is it pre-scrolled to that selected font or is the scroll visible?"],["3d3d5d89_49e66cae",46,-15,1,"Is there a TODO we can insert here Nohemi?"],["3d66e162_b0594ea4",42,-15,1,"nit: possible to move the feature flag creation into a separate CL?"],["4efae8df_e0450dd0",45,-15,0,"My 2c is that either poppins or lexend should be the default font."],["5b70b7b0_db5cf204",45,-15,1,"Can you extract all the shared properties into a style?"],["66bd843a_27fc89e9",47,-15,1,"Is NOTREACHED not supported here?"],["676f7264_510ffa47",19,-15,1,"Would ensuring that inflation is finished simplify things for you here? You could write a method which verifies both inflation is complete and the distilled page prefs are available, and call it from…"],["8266baaf_b83ecefc",45,-15,0,"Should the new fonts be at the front of the list?"],["0e49ee65_2148c126",23,-14,0,"If we need to specify multiple weights, this can be done with the following syntax (for Lexend as an example) `https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Lexend:200,400`"],["f3790e93_b51d610c",23,-14,1,"Can you see if we could use an import instead? <link href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lexend&family=Poppins&family=Roboto'; rel='stylesheet' type='text/css'>"],["724eb43c_147f5c7e",45,-7,0,"Might need to use a different container with the new specs."],["16b3d684_b489fa9e",44,-1,1,"Given that we will be adding a single new font and that this patch will cover mobile platforms (if extended with the iOS-related change), I would be happy to move forward with a waterfall rollout…"],["8d182eb3_fd8839a1",48,-1,1,"Can we limit this patch to adding Lexend font family only?"],["51b546d2_8425feff",49,0,1,"Revert"],["5864abec_96d33136",50,0,1,"Remove"],["6787f19d_8743eb74",17,0,1,"Why is this removed?"],["6ff73cc0_e48ca179",26,0,1,"Revert new line."],["acec8278_601ffdde",17,0,1,"Why is this removed?"],["e72f2852_afe0544a",51,0,1,"I would like to do additional testing on the iOS side before we enable by default, which I won't have time to do now. Feel free to revert this just for iOS."]],0,41]]}